{"version":1,"content":"<p>曾於紐約及邁阿密享負盛名的美國富豪地產經紀亞歷山大（Alexander）三兄弟，因涉嫌長年利用財富與社交地位性侵超過70名女子，周二（27日）在紐約曼哈頓聯邦法院各被判監30年。</p><p>法官指責三人行為「殘忍」，並指他們對受害者造成了長期的心理創傷。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T11:01:28.907513+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T10:26:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:38:10.683472+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T10:58:15.414779+00:00","content_hash":"d91a41b198b72f2ecd20ec9f824fccd1548033f20fb00fde2ec798f4663f3778","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}